.DS_Store

# macOS tar and Finder fabricate AppleDouble sidecar files from extended
# attributes. sqlx::migrate!() embeds the migrations directory at compile time and
# rejects any file that is not NNNN_name.sql, so one stray ._0005_worker_heartbeats.sql
# fails the image build with a confusing parse error rather than a missing file.
._*
**/._*

# Credentials and nested environment files. The top-level patterns above only
# match the repository root, and the web Dockerfile copies its whole app
# directory, so a stray apps/web/.env would otherwise enter the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
gha-creds-*.json
